These two files are the three.js r170 examples

  examples/jsm/postprocessing/Pass.js
  examples/jsm/postprocessing/RenderPixelatedPass.js

RenderPixelatedPass was written by Kody King and ships with three.js.
They are covered by the MIT license in vendor/three/LICENSE
(Copyright © 2010-2024 three.js authors). The text of that license
is reproduced below so this directory stands on its own.

Local change: the two color targets use UnsignedByteType instead of
HalfFloatType. The pixel shader is otherwise the r170 source. Depth
is still a DepthTexture. Unsigned byte keeps the pass working on
WebGL2 software renderers and matches this game's unmapped colors.

